<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA 1.3 Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="t00219">
	<title id="e01357">Removing headrest </title>
	<taskbody>
		<context>
			<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01358">
				<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
					<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
					<tbody>
						<row rowsep="1">
							<entry colname="col1">
								<fig id="e01359">
									<title>Type A</title>
									<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_026_1.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
							<entry colname="col2">
								<fig id="e01360">
									<title>Type B</title>
									<image href="images/N_SP327_B06_027_1.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
								</fig>
							</entry>
						</row>
					</tbody>
				</tgroup>
			</table>
			<p>To remove the headrest:</p>
		</context>
		<steps id="e01361">
			<step id="e01362">
				<cmd>Recline the seatback with the recline lever or switch.</cmd>
			</step>
			<step>
				<cmd>Push and hold the release button (1). Raise headrest as far as it can go.</cmd>
				<info>
					<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01363">
						<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
							<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
							<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
							<tbody>
								<row rowsep="1">
									<entry colname="col1">
										<fig id="e01364">
											<image href="images/N_SP327_C06_013_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
										</fig>
									</entry>
									<entry colname="col2"/>
								</row>
							</tbody>
						</tgroup>
					</table></info>
			</step>
			<step id="e01365">
				<cmd>Insert a short, flat object (such as a small flat-head screwdriver) into the opening on the inside base of the left post (2) and pull the headrest upward.</cmd>
				<info>
					<note type="warning">
						<p>Removing headrest</p>
						<p>NEVER allow anyone to ride in a seat with the headrest removed or reversed. Headrests can provide critical neck and head support in a crash.</p>
					</note>
				</info>
			</step>
		</steps>
	</taskbody>
	<related-links>
		<linkpool>
			<link format="dita" href="t00216.dita#t00216" role="parent" scope="local" type="concept">
				<linktext>Front seat headrest</linktext>
			</link>
		</linkpool>
	</related-links>
</task>